  so successfully  and the truth is that the sao formula  may well be the future  of anime if we take a look at the surge  in isekai anime in recent years it is  clear that the goal of most of these  anime is to attract viewers with an  intriguing premise an ordinary person  just like you  ends up in a really cool fantasy world  full of women who want you  and plot twist you are also extremely  powerful despite being completely new to  this world and then once they suck  viewers in with the escapist power  fantasy premise  they spend very little effort on  character development and plot  the protagonist is always good pure  overpowered and a chick magnet and of  course his enemies are all evil  one-dimensional psychopaths who are  defeated  as soon as he finds a new more powerful  sword or spell  or nunchucks or whatever this formula  could be the future of anime because  it's easier to produce  shows of this type it's easier to create  a cool premise and then just make  formulaic arcs in which the protagonist  is kicking ass in roughly the same way  every time  only the villains and the items being  used to defeat the villains are changing  it is much harder to create a gripping  and coherent overarching plotline that  includes meaningful character  development for all the relevant cast  members  and that treats its villains as actual  multi-dimensional human beings with  complex  thoughts feelings and motivations as far  as sword art  online goes i think it gets more hate  than it deserves and i will definitely  still watch the alicization arc as it  comes out in anime form  but sao has the potential to be so  much better and we need to expect more  from franchises like  sao otherwise the future of anime will  be series with intriguing concepts that  never put in the work  necessary to achieve their full  potential and we are going to keep  seeing a bunch of bad  sao clones like isekaiwa smartphone  popping up  every new anime season at least that's  my opinion  but let me know what you guys think do  you agree with my take on  sao and the future of anime or do you  think that i'm wrong an isekaiwa  smartphone is actually a modern classic  let me know down below if you enjoyed  this video you want to see more videos  like it leave a like to let me know  if you're new to the channel don't  forget to subscribe and hit that  notification bell  also be sure to follow us on twitter and  instagram at anime uproar for all the  latest updates  and a big thank you to ac design for  editing this and other videos for us  he's doing a great job be sure to check  him out link in the description  as always thank you all so much for  watching and until next time see ya  space cowboys  [Music]

